  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1301.03 Exemptions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1301.03 Exemptions. The following sources shall be exempt from this chapter:\n\n(a) Any stationary source having combined theoretical potential emissions of less than 50 tons of NOx during any consecutive 12-month period since January 1, 1989;\n\n(b) Temporary boilers that have theoretical potential emissions of less than 50 tons of NOx during any consecutive 12-month period; and\n\n(c) Stationary combustion turbines mounted on aircraft.\n\nSource. #12584, eff 8-15-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1300.html"
}
